ion calling for single Palestinian state, which is opposed by most Green MPs, passes by 1,022 votes to 813 at party’s conferenceUK politics live – latest updatesThe Greens have formally adopted a policy which equates Zionism with racism and calls for Israel to be replaced by a single Palestinian state.In a move opposed by the bulk of the party’s MPs, members voted at the party’s annual conferen","published":"2026-10-04T23:58:27+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"related":[],"title_ko":"녹색당, 시오니즘과 인종차별을 동일시하는 정책 채택 찬성","summary_ko":"대부분의 녹색당 의원들이 반대하는 단일 팔레스타인 국가를 촉구하는 운동이 당의 회의에서 1,022표에서 813표로 통과되었습니다. 영국 정치 생중계 – 최신 업데이트 녹색당은 시오니즘을 인종차별주의와 동일시하고 이스라엘을 단일 팔레스타인 국가로 대체할 것을 요구하는 정책을 공식적으로 채택했습니다. 당의 많은 의원들이 반대하는 움직임으로, 의원들은 당의 연례 회의에서 투표했습니다."},{"title":"젤렌스키 \"美, 10월 중 러·우크라와 3자 평화회담 개최 제안\"","url":"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20261004043900108","source":"연합뉴스","summary":"(이스탄불=연합뉴스) 김동호 특파원 = 미국이 러시아와 우크라이나 사이에서 중재하는 평화 회담을 이달 내로 개최하는 방안을 제안했다고 볼로디미르...","published":"2026-10-04T23:50:19+09:00","related_total":0,"related":[]},{"title":"Houthis Claim Attack on Aramco as Yemen Conflict Escalates","url":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/04/world/middleeast/houthis-oil-attack-saudi-arabia-yemen.html","source":"New York Times","summary":"The announcement plunges the Middle East deeper into war, as the Iran-allied Houthis have scored a series of triumphs in Yemen on the battlefield since the conflict was reignited.","published":"2026-10-04T23:46:27+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":4,"related":[{"title":"Yemen announces military campaign to reclaim land from Iran-backed Houthis","url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx8dzj9vpp01o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss","source":"BBC World","published":"2026-10-04T23:24:56+09:00"},{"title":"Yemen's leader announces counter-offensive as Houthis cut off supply route to besieged city","url":"https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261004-yemen-leader-announces-counter-offensive-as-houthis-cut-off-supply-route-besieged-city